Open Regard was extracted and generalized from Startup Tier's display-preferences
work, with authorization from its owner. Site-specific styles remain site-owned.
The eye artwork in Open Regard is original and does not copy Lucide assets.
The runnable React demonstration bundles React/React DOM/Scheduler; their MIT
license notices are preserved in dist/react-demo.js.LEGAL.txt by esbuild.
The example source viewers and website documentation use highlight.js styling;
its license is included in dist/highlight.LICENSE. Highlighting runs at build time.
